  "details": "I think it would be pretty cool for avatars to have statistics that are publicly viewable similar to Worlds. This has been a heavily demanded feature by the community for over 6 years. \n\nAvatars could have information like. \n\n- Current users\n\n- Total users\n\n- Favorites\n\nCreators could get more detailed statistics such as\n\n- Worlds the avatar was displayed on a pedestal in\n\n- Amount of times cloned\n\n- Platform pie chart (Which platform is the most used)\n\n- If any of your friends use the avatar or have it favorited\n\nIt would also be cool for avatar search worlds to be able to show what the most used and favorited avatars in VRChat are and even the least used so they can get more popular. \n\nMaking the statistics public would also drive the community to want to get the most popular avatar in the game and that would be great for promoting avatar creators and getting more people to use the in game store and creating content in general.",
